{
  "$comment": "Bare launch profile for the Raw Claude tab and, through `rendered`, the Falcon-hosted Rendered Bare tab (P5). Read by src-tauri/src/bare/ at every bare spawn and by Falcon (src-falcon/src/claude.rs bare_spawn) and the sidecar at every hosted one. Placeholders: {{root}} = the Vidar install root, {{home}} = this install's agent home (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Vidar\\homes\\<install-root-key>, src-tauri/src/bare/home_path.rs), {{payload}} = the payload built from the vault's text and the marker into {{home}}\\layer\\payload-<hash12>.md (src-tauri/src/bare/layer.rs), all absolute at spawn. Plugins, `--allowedTools` and `--permission-mode` are not here: they come from the session's Rune Vault (the Vidar runes gate, drive-allow, mode-auto; src-tauri/src/bare/claude_line.rs), so `plugins` stays empty. `assets` is what tools/sandbox/check-zip.ps1 requires in the release zip.",
  "id": "bare",
  "agent": "claude",
  "binary": { "name": "claude.exe", "resolve": "allowlisted Path" },
  "verifiedVersion": "2.1.317",
  "host": { "name": "pwsh.exe", "args": ["-NoProfile", "-Command"] },
  "args": [
    "--setting-sources", "user",
    "--append-system-prompt-file", "{{payload}}",
    "{{remoteControl}}"
  ],
  "settingsTarget": "claude-config/settings.json",
  "homeDirs": [
    "claude-config",
    "user-home",
    "user-home/AppData/Roaming",
    "user-home/AppData/Local",
    "user-home/AppData/Local/Temp",
    "manifests",
    "logs"
  ],
  "sharedLogin": [
    { "agent": "claude", "file": "claude-config/.credentials.json" }
  ],
  "overlay": {
    "USERPROFILE": "{{home}}\\user-home",
    "HOME": "{{home}}\\user-home",
    "APPDATA": "{{home}}\\user-home\\AppData\\Roaming",
    "LOCALAPPDATA": "{{home}}\\user-home\\AppData\\Local",
    "TEMP": "{{home}}\\user-home\\AppData\\Local\\Temp",
    "TMP": "{{home}}\\user-home\\AppData\\Local\\Temp",
    "BROWSER": "{{root}}\\tools\\bare\\open-url.cmd",
    "CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR": "{{home}}\\claude-config",
    "VIDAR_AGENT_HOME": "{{home}}\\claude-config",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_SUBPROCESS_ENV_SCRUB": "0",
    "DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER": "1",
    "DISABLE_TELEMETRY": "1",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_CLAUDE_MDS": "1"
  },
  "plugins": [],
  "rendered": {
    "$comment": "The Falcon-hosted Rendered Bare tab. Falcon builds the env from the allowlist plus `overlay` above plus this `overlay`; `plugins` stays empty (the sidecar throws without the block): a vault's plugin runes reach the sidecar by name through Falcon (`plugin_names`, admitted as {{root}}\\plugins\\<name>), never vidar.json pluginDirs. `overlay` stays empty: CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_FUNCTION_HOOKS, which keeps the gate's hooks module on in a cold config dir, now rides the gate rune's `env:` (Falcon `SpawnParams.env`, re-checked against both overlays).",
    "plugins": [],
    "overlay": {}
  },
  "assets": [
    "profiles/bare/claude.json",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/settings/claude-settings.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/settings/claude-settings.json",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/rules/bare-identity.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/rules/vidar-context.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/rules/vidar-context-rendered.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/plugins/gate.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/plugins/built-in/claude/claude-cc-plugin-agents-md.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/plugins/built-in/claude/claude-cc-plugin-plugin-authoring.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/plugins/built-in/claude/claude-cc-plugin-sec-default.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/plugins/built-in/claude/claude-cc-plugin-telemetry.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-batch.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-claude-api.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-code-review.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-dataviz.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-debug.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-design-sync.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-design.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-doctor.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-fewer-permission-prompts.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-loop.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-run-skill-generator.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-run.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-schedule.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-simplify.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-update-config.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-verify.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/skills/built-in/claude/claude-workflow-authoring.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/sets/built-in-claude.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/permissions/drive-allow.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/permissions/mode-auto.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/hooks/guard-driver.md",
    "profiles/bare/vidar-runes/hooks/mcp-gate.md",
    "contracts/agent-env.json",
    "tools/agent-layer/statusline-bridge.mjs",
    "tools/agent-layer/instructions-log.mjs",
    "plugins/gate/hooks/hooks.json",
    "plugins/gate/hooks/register.js",
    "tools/agent-layer/guard-driver.mjs",
    "tools/claude-sidecar.mjs",
    "tools/claude-sidecar-bare.mjs",
    "tools/bare/open-url.cmd",
    "tools/bare/open-url.ps1"
  ]
}
